      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Switching now brings windows forward even when they&#x27;re on another desktop or minimized. Fixes switching sometimes doing nothing when the mouse pointer rested where the switcher opens.</p>]]></description>
