      <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Click a preview to switch to it. Hovering selects a preview, and once you&#x27;ve used the mouse, letting go of ⌥ keeps the switcher open until you click (click outside or press esc to close).</p>]]></description>
